commit 6a0c8c27ca3a56cdb891a10c9b8b9e3e383f0ff2
Author: Matt Voget <matt.voget@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Aug 7 21:16:53 2026 -0600

    fix(cost): E2BIG — pass all large payloads via files, never env vars; reconciler warnings to stdout (#123)
    
    Lando's own escalation diagnosed the reconciler death: the paginated
    timeline JSON passed to python via env var exceeded the kernel's ~128KB
    per-env-string limit (E2BIG at exec), masked by the reconciler's exit 0 +
    stderr-only warnings. All payload passing (timeline, comments recovery,
    scan/baseline) now goes through temp files; reconciler warnings print to
    stdout so the cron report surfaces them. +E2BIG regression test (300KB
    timeline).
    
    Co-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

